Test data
  internal/resources/testdata/properties_parser.txt contains a copy of
  org/apache/tools/ant/taskdefs/defaults.properties from Apache Ant 1.10.11
  (Apache License 2.0), which the pinned closure-compiler.jar bundles.
  Ant's NOTICE reads:

    Apache Ant
    Copyright 1999-2021 The Apache Software Foundation

    This product includes software developed at
    The Apache Software Foundation (https://www.apache.org/).

    The <sync> task is based on code Copyright (c) 2002, Landmark
    Graphics Corp that has been kindly donated to the Apache Software
    Foundation.

  Some test inputs are files of third-party npm packages, copied from the
  registry tarball of the version their directory names:
  internal/jscomp/testdata/<dir>/src/<package>@<version>/package/, where
  <dir> is typecheck (T), es_modules (E), closure_modules (C),
  serialization (S), renaming (R) or replace_messages (M). Each
  <package>@<version>/ directory also holds the package's licence file,
  from the same tarball, under the package's own file name; "go run
  ./tools/licenses -check" requires one. typecheck/expected/ and the
  goldens next to src/ hold the Java compiler's output for these files.
  No package is under a copyleft licence, and none ships a NOTICE file.

